@*
    Premium animated aurora backdrop for auth / form / hero pages. The <canvas> is painted by
    Scripts/components/aurora.ts (canvas 2D — CSP-safe, no inline script/style). Purely decorative and
    pointer-events:none; the vignette sinks the edges back into surface-0 so foreground text stays readable.
    Rendered by _Layout when a page sets ViewData["Aurora"] = true. Reduced motion → a single static frame.
*@
<div class="aurora-bg" aria-hidden="true">
    <canvas data-aurora class="aurora-canvas"></canvas>
    <div class="aurora-vignette"></div>
</div>
